{"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"],"title":"Essentials","anchor":"Essentials","generated":true}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/goingtoproduction"]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A wallet holding real credentials is only as trustworthy as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform it runs on. The package enforces some of this itself: without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development"},{"type":"text","text":", receiving credentials needs a key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store and a credential store that both say they’re durable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore\/isDurable"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/isDurable"},{"type":"text","text":"), and services on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loopback addresses are refused. The rest is the app’s."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Keys-and-storage","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Keys and storage"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Keep ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"’s defaults: keys in the Secure Enclave,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"persistent, and holder keys asking for Face ID, Touch ID or the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passcode before each presentation. Add ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"text":" to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Info.plist.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":": complete data protection, out of backups."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is for tests."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" at launch, before any issuance,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so keys an interrupted issuance left don’t accumulate."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Make one "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" per key store and credential store, and share it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the app’s life. Two over the same stores don’t coordinate: both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"could present the same copy of a credential, so Verifiers could link"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the presentations, or redeem the same refresh token, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authorization server revokes the grant."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A device restored from a backup has no holder keys: its credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"show ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/holderKeyPresent","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" as false and can’t be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"presented. Delete them, and receive them again."}]}]}]},{"anchor":"The-Wallet-Provider","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"The Wallet Provider"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Issuers trust the wallet because its Wallet Provider attests it. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"production Wallet Provider should attest a wallet and its keys only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after checking App Attest evidence that it’s talking to your genuine"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app on a genuine device, and should keep its own signing key in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"HSM. The demo wallet’s provider attests anything, and is for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"development only."}]},{"anchor":"Trust","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Trust"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Configure only your ecosystem’s roots: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/issuerRoots"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for credentials, ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots"},{"text":" for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Verifiers the wallet answers, and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/registrarRoots"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only for registrars, never for Verifiers or issuers, which could then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"register themselves.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For readers, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRequireEKU"},{"text":", and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader"},{"text":" where every reader","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"must be a known one.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Never ship with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development"},{"text":" set.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To pin your services’ certificates, set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/tlsPins"},{"text":": host → base64 SHA-256 digests of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificate’s SubjectPublicKeyInfo. Pin a CA’s key, so a leaf renewal","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t break the app, and keep a backup pin: a wrong set locks the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wallet out of that host until an update. Pins cover the SDK’s own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"requests, which ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPinnedDomains","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" doesn’t reach, not your app’s, such","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as to your Wallet Provider: pin that ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLSession","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" yourself.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To refuse certificates your ecosystem’s CAs have revoked, list the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"roles to check in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/revocation","isActive":true},{"text":" and give their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"CAs’ CRLs (PEM ","type":"text"},{"code":"X509 CRL","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" blocks) in ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/crls","isActive":true},{"text":". A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"role listed fails closed for any CA it has no current CRL from, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"list only roles whose CAs publish CRLs. CRLs expire at their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nextUpdate: fetch fresh ones in the background and hand them over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/o